{
  "_comment": "An H2 or H3 equal to the title of a live page is a link card (related articles) and never counts as a section. broad: when no page holds every word of the subject as most of its own subject, and at least min_pages pages score within margin of the best (below max_score), the subject is new and broad (pillar candidate), with those pages listed. word_weights: from min_lines registry lines on, each word weighs max(floor, 1 - slope x share of the lines that hold it) in the Jaccard, so words every page shares count less. drop_small_numbers removes listicle counts (12 meilleurs). joins rewrites a split spelling into one word before tokens (start up, startup). Single source of the topic registry rules (scripts/topics.py). A project overrides any key with a topics object in its config.json (--config). Scores run from 0 to 1: Jaccard of the normalized, stemmed tokens of two texts, raised by substring_weight x (1 - Jaccard) when the shorter token sequence appears whole and in order inside the longer one. check: a score >= duplicate against the query, an alias or the title of a live page, a brief or a draft is a duplicate; >= refresh_main against them, or >= refresh_section against one of their H2 or H3, is a refresh of that URL (or that brief); anything else is new. A proposed topic never blocks: it is reported as already proposed. propose groups two ideas when their score >= cluster. A subject of two words or more whose every word is in the query, an alias or the title of a live page is a duplicate when its words make at least duplicate_contained of that text's words (a broad subject inside a longer page stays a refresh). The substring bonus only counts a registry text inside the subject when it has two words or more. Pages under a /xx/ language prefix rank after the pages of the site's default language unless the subject is in that language (English detected by its stop words; default_language, null by default, names the language of unprefixed pages).",
  "thresholds": {
    "duplicate": 0.85,
    "refresh_main": 0.55,
    "refresh_section": 0.55,
    "cluster": 0.75,
    "duplicate_contained": 0.7
  },
  "substring_weight": 0.5,
  "min_token_length": 2,
  "drop_years": true,
  "drop_small_numbers": true,
  "word_weights": {
    "min_lines": 30,
    "floor": 0.2,
    "slope": 2.0
  },
